h a single, unified interface. Built for developers who want to focus on building, not integrating.</p></div><div class="lg:pl-8 order-1 lg:order-2 pt-8 lg:pt-0 w-full overflow-hidden"><video src="/assets/videos/trading_agent.mp4" autoPlay="" loop="" muted="" playsInline="" class="w-full h-auto object-contain rounded-xl"></video></div></div></div></section><div class="" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px)"><section class="bg-[#e67307] py-8 overflow-hidden"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="text-center mb-4"><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Supported Platforms</h2><p class="text-[#ffdebd] text-lg">Connect with the platforms you already use</p></div><div class="relative"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="flex items-center gap-16 md:gap-20 lg:gap-24" style="width:max-content"><div class="flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center" style="width:180px;height:90px"><img alt="Kalshi logo" loading="lazy" width="180" height="90" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain filter brightness-0 invert opacity-90 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 max-w-full max-h-full" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Flogos%2Fkalshi.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Flogos%2Fkalshi.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Flogos%2Fkalshi.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center" style="width:180px;height:90px"><img alt="Polymarket logo" loading="lazy" width="180" height="90" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain filter brightness-0 invert opacity-90 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 max-w-full max-h-full" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/logos/polymarket.svg"/></div><div class="flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center" style="width:180px;height:90px"><img alt="Manifold logo" loading="lazy" width="180" height="90" decoding="async" data-nim